        "original_id": "ad719f0a-1b06-5261-9cc3-6988e0625f9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marge Simpson, Homer Simpson, Julie Kavner, Dan Castellaneta, Matt Groening, Margaret Groening\n- Works: The Tracey Ullman Show, Good Night, The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular, The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set\n\nFacts:\n- Marge Simpson first appeared on television in The Tracey Ullman Show short Good Night on April 19, 1987.\n- Homer Simpson first appeared on television with his family in The Tracey Ullman Show short Good Night on April 19, 1987.\n- Julie Kavner voices Marge Simpson.\n- Dan Castellaneta voices Homer Simpson.\n- Matt Groening named Marge Simpson after his mother Margaret Groening.\n- Good Night was later aired in its entirety in The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular.\n- Good Night was included in The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set and is one of the few Tracey Ullman shorts released on DVD.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
